Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:17:41 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 09/37] bitproxy: Always-on/lockdown badge and stop
 confirmation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dashboard shows 'Always-on ✓ · Block ✓' or a warning that opens the
system VPN settings (VpnService.isAlwaysOn/isLockdownEnabled, API 29+,
live while the service runs, last known value otherwise). With lockdown
on, stopping from the dashboard asks for confirmation because it cuts
internet for all apps.
Upstream hooks: two lines in DashboardScreen, one in DashboardViewModel.
---
